e": "Screenshot_20260401_133940.png", "id": "2040809573526136", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491820956_2040809576859469_3787236777641519400_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Oa5d2DU9cIAQ7kNvwF97YNw&_nc_oc=AdocmyVY-xl0ZNTpxXbWfA0dE4xXDgSA-mHRLmWI6ycvJO8LQZPbEi5UU6fOi-t7sQA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQHY4dcbYcEvpWKX8Oa37dUXVIIILV95Qz3XxH6QIOnJTw&oe=6A772A42"}, {"file_name": "Screenshot_20260401_133956.png", "id": "833393285700076", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491820428_833393292366742_7340121889143581301_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=NYh4_cWLyMkQ7kNvwHk_80E&_nc_oc=AdqlnELwCO1dyPpuJQKcOu-cuw1hX9uCIfBAtnYN2JsLV-hVe7dxXQebCQWCEdp6exs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQGD3sGYxTohLbGjTnxhxIfRiLWWtolXXHAXBJ-EnNGUvw&oe=6A771AAF"}, {"file_name": "Screenshot_20260401_134123.png", "id": "1237185035295679", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491824210_1237185038629012_3645691414174324526_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=JwKP0EoBef0Q7kNvwEdKwD2&_nc_oc=Adqneo6G_KOL4bGJRlKZgjHeLRbulDM1pd4uJQ4spUXqh_pL3Q_N4n9h_MjIx_M0YJE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQFOypgl9QRgMajFnnHvqu_nJVO0VCeteFVP2kFME-zf5A&oe=6A771A5C"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "GoView", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Imagine you are guiding a group in VR.\n\nThey put on their headsets and get a new set of eyes, while you stay in the real world. You are supposed to guide them in a world you are effectively blind to.\n\nAs if managing a group wasn\u2019t challenging enough.\n\n\u201cGo to the left!\u201d\n\u201cNo, your other left\u2026\u201d\n\u201cPress that button.\u201d\n\u201cWhat button?\u201d\n\nPeople get stuck, move on, or lose focus \u2014 and you don\u2019t even see it happening.\n\nThis application gives you that visibility back.\n\nIt shows local Android-based devices (such as Meta, Pico, Samsung and AOSP) in a real-time monitoring dashboard with a grid layout.\n\nEach device appears as a tile. You can scan all users, select one, or switch to full-screen. The interface adapts automatically and supports pagination.\n\nDevices are automatically discovered within the local network, allowing quick setup.\n\nThe system scales with your network. In a typical subnet, up to ~254 devices can be addressed. Performance depends on bandwidth and hardware.\n\nRunning locally ensures low latency and reliable performance.\n\nKey features:\n - Multi-device real-time monitoring \n - Low-latency streaming \n - Grid-based dashboard with full-screen view \n - Automatic device discovery \n - Network-based scalability (~254 devices per subnet) \n - No ads \n\nCurrently in beta, with ongoing improvements and upcoming features.", "short_description": "See what users see in VR. Monitor multiple Android XR devices in real time through a live dashboard. Built for low latency and tested in training, education, and enterprise environments."}, {"images": {"nodes": []}, "id": "1322232122710960", "locale": "nl_NL", "screenshots": [], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "GoView", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Stel je voor dat je een groep begeleidt in VR.\n\nZij zetten hun headsets op en krijgen een nieuw paar ogen, terwijl jij in de echte wereld blijft. Je moet hen begeleiden in een wereld waar je in feite niets van ziet.\n\nAlsof het begeleiden van een groep nog niet uitdagend genoeg was.\n\n\u201cGa naar links!\u201d\n\u201cNee, je andere links\u2026\u201d\n\nMensen lopen vast, gaan verder of verliezen hun focus \u2014 en jij ziet het niet eens gebeuren.\n\nDeze applicatie geeft je dat inzicht terug.\n\nHet toont lokale Android-apparaten (zoals Meta, Pico, Samsung en AOSP) in een realtime monitoringdashboard met een rasterlay-out.\n\nElk apparaat wordt weergegeven als een tegel. Je kunt alle gebruikers scannen, er \u00e9\u00e9n selecteren of overschakelen naar volledig scherm. De interface past zich automatisch aan en ondersteunt paginering.\n\nApparaten worden automatisch gedetecteerd binnen het lokale netwerk, waardoor een snelle installatie mogelijk is.\n\nHet systeem schaalt mee met je netwerk. In een typisch subnet kunnen tot ~254 apparaten worden aangesproken. De prestaties zijn afhankelijk van bandbreedte en hardware.\n\nLokaal draaien zorgt voor lage latentie en betrouwbare prestaties.\n\nBelangrijkste functies:\n - Real-time monitoring van meerdere apparaten \n - Streaming met lage latentie \n - Dashboard op basis van een raster met volledig scherm \n - Automatische detectie van apparaten \n - Schaalbaarheid op basis van het netwerk (~254 apparaten per subnet) \n - Geen advertenties \n\nMomenteel in b\u00e8ta, met voortdurende verbeteringen en nieuwe functies in aantocht.", "short_description": "Bekijk wat gebruikers in VR zien. Houd meerdere Android XR-apparaten in realtime in de gaten via een live dashboard. Ontworpen voor een lage latentie en getest in opleidings-, onderwijs- en bedrijfsomgevingen."}]}, "developer_name": "EMAGINE B.V.", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://gist.github.com/arturpasiut/91ae6826cd0deabe81472416e706477f", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "EMAGINE B.V.", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://e-magine.nl/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "393222478507326"}, {"id": "1063584910766706"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en", "af", "am", "ar", "bn", "de", "eu", "fr", "hi", "id", "it", "ja", "jv", "ka", "nl", "pl", "pt", "ru", "es", "uk", "uz", "zh_CN", "en_US", "en_GB"], "supported_input_devices": ["HAND_TRACKING", "OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "27276598962004377"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 3, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "996312689818998"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1514177487118133"}, {"status": "PENDING", "id": "1224836189728628"}]}, "baseline_offer": {"id": "996312689818998"}, "is_approved": true, "firstOffer": {"nodes": [{"start_time": 1781965140, "status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "996312689818998"}]}, "liveChannel": {"nodes": [{"latest_supported_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "id": "26647558588241754", "version": "0.0.4"}, "id": "2448369352274973", "channel_name": "LIVE"}]}, "is_for_oculus_keys_only": false, "primary_binaries": {"nodes": [{"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "25933157619681858", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "26647558588241754"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "2448369352274973"}]}, "change_log": null, "created_date": 1776429199, "id": "26647558588241754", "version": "0.0.4", "version_code": 4, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "25933157619681858", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "26647558588241754"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": []}, "cha